<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MEN'S SINGLES QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MEN'S SINGLES QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Men's singles quarter-final</p>
<p>results at the Wimbledon tennis championships on Thursday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Cedric Pioline (France) beat Greg Rusedski (Britain) 6-4 4-6 6-4</p>
<p>6-3</p>
